 faithful exploration of  what it's like to learn the magical arts  inside of that school set in the 1800s  you'll build your character up with an  upgrade tree grow your skills by brewing  potions and form friendships with your  fellow classmates though the game is set  in the popular wizarding world universe  it has been overshadowed at times by  remarks from harry potter creator jk  rowling the author has been criticized  for her transphobic comments over the  past several years and if you'd like to  know more please read jessie earle's  feature on why rowling's statements have  been so hurtful to the trans community  the link to the article will be down  below  but okay let's switch gears to alden  ring now because there's just no  escaping the game even if i wanted to  you can't hide from it now that valve  has finally fixed some of the major  issues that were plaguing elder ring  players on steam deck the company has  explained how it went about improving  stability in a discussion with digital  foundry a coder for valve has explained  how the company worked around the  problems that were previously reported  by players including the stuttering  frame rate issue that was brought up  last month as a top priority although  the stuttering issues seem to be  resolved on steam deck the issue is  still present on standard pc versions of  the game valve explained that most of  the elden ring issues were caused by  other factors saying that the shader  pipeline driven stutter wasn't the  majority of the problems the team has  seen in the game  [Music]  mario kart's new but old tracks are out  today this is wave one of eight and it  includes tracks like coconut mall paris  promenade and sky garden just to name a  few it's also important to note that if  you're a nintendo switch online plus  expansion pack member you get these at  no additional cost so make sure you  download those and show your siblings  who's boss have a good weekend i'll see  you next week  [Music]
 

